<rml><head><title>Upstream rendering laboratory</title><style>
body { margin: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; font-family: body; color: #eef3fa; font-size: 15px; }
div, h1, p { display: block; }
.panel { position: absolute; left: 24px; top: 82px; width: 560px; max-width: 90%; padding: 16px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #17263bea; pointer-events: auto; }
h1 { font-family: heading; font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
p { margin: 8px 0; }
button { display: inline-block; margin: 5px 4px 0 0; padding: 7px; background: #263b53; color: #eef3fa; border-width: 0; tab-index: auto; font-family: body; font-size: 13px; }
button:hover, button:focus { background: #375973; }
#render-counts { white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 13px; }
</style></head><body><div class="panel"><h1>Upstream rendering laboratory</h1>
<p>Edit the camera and mesh component properties. Diagnostics are controlled through MCP.</p>
<button id="render-frustum_culling">frustum_culling</button><button id="render-static_instancing">static_instancing</button><button id="render-static_lod">static_lod</button><button id="render-atmosphere">atmosphere</button><button id="render-hex">hex</button><button id="render-camera">camera</button><p id="render-status"></p><p id="render-counts"></p></div></body></rml>
